v3.official [9d84f3d13]\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.6.dev3 - Windows 11 (build 26100) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3060 Ti (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.7680) - 13th Gen Intel(R) Core(TM) i5-13600KF (20 threads) - 47.84 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4746adc3-4b7c-430f-9d99-beb6faf8b559\n\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/e6aa06d3de372513bedb036d2adb1052a9b4b87f/editor/script/find_in_files.cpp#L864-L876\n\nSearch results can keep original information if contents have been modified such as line number, matches count. \nSearch results might also contain users' operation traces such as vertical scroll position, highlighted item.\nIf rebuilding the search tree, these old information will be lost.\n\nOn the other hand, there may be many search results (introduced by #104676 ), when the user changes the theme, each of which will rebuild the search tree causing the engine to stutter, maybe.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Search something\n2. Change editor theme's `Style` or `Color Preset`\n3. FindInFiles result will search automatically.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nNA\n\n","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy